{'symbol': 'ALLE', 'date': '2021-03-04 17:00:00', 'title': 'ALLEGION CLOSES ON SALE OF QMI', 'text': "DUBLIN--(BUSINESS WIRE)--ALLEGION PLC (NYSE: ALLE), THROUGH ONE OF ITS SUBSIDIARIES, HAS CLOSED ON THE SALE OF ITS QATAR METAL INDUSTRIES (QMI) BUSINESS TO THE HLD GROUP OF COMPANIES, A PRIVATE INDUSTRIAL PORTFOLIO OF COMPANIES BASED IN THE UK. TERMS OF THE TRANSACTION, WHICH CLOSED ON FEB. 28, 2021, ARE NOT DISCLOSED. THE DIVESTITURE OF QMI – A COMMERCIAL DOOR MANUFACTURER IN THE MIDDLE EAST – WAS PREVIOUSLY ANNOUNCED AS A PART OF ALLEGION'S 2020 FOURTH-QUARTER, FULL-YEAR EARNINGS CALL AND REL"}